{"seq":3,"slug":"data-plane","title":"数据平面","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/zero-trust-architecture/data-plane","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ztna-sdp","title":"ZTNA 与软件定义边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/zero-trust-architecture/data-plane/ztna-sdp","wordCount":1249,"readingTime":5},{"seq":2,"slug":"identity-aware-proxy","title":"身份感知代理模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/zero-trust-architecture/data-plane/identity-aware-proxy","wordCount":1194,"readingTime":5},{"seq":3,"slug":"sase-convergence","title":"SASE 架构与网安融合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/zero-trust-architecture/data-plane/sase-convergence","wordCount":1514,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"# 数据平面\n\n零信任的策略需要在数据平面得到实际执行。本章聚焦三种主流数据平面模式：ZTNA/SDP 的应用级隐身接入、身份感知代理（IAP）的请求级验证、以及 SASE 将网络与安全能力融合为统一云服务的架构演进。\n\n三篇文档从\"隐藏应用\"到\"代理验证\"再到\"网安融合\"，逐步展开数据平面的技术实现与架构选型。\n"}